      "Peak RSS includes the entire process, JIT and runtime; it is not live-object size or an isolated collector metric. Different GC modes have different memory footprints and cleanup policies.",
      "Server JIT at eight workers is faster in this workload than Neri at its best measured worker count. This does not establish a language-wide ranking or a causal breakdown of the allocation gap.",
